{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVH3mo9rqsRfn8EbyN2s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition | stipulation | cut*\n\n---\n\n```\nש ר ט\n├─┼─┤\n│ │ │\nS-R-T\n```\n\n---\n\nשָׁרְט: the incision that binds\n\nשַׁרְט: to scratch, to cut into flesh\nשָׂרַט: ritual scarification \nתְּנַאי: that which is conditional\n\n---\n\n**I am the mark before the covenant**\n**The wound that seals agreement**\n**The line drawn in skin and contract**\n\n---\n\n```\n     ┌──────────────────┐\n     │  IF    ∴   THEN  │\n     │   ↓         ↓    │\n     │ شَرط  ═══  שֶׁרֶט │\n     │   ↓         ↓    │\n     │ condition │ cut  │\n     └──────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n*Arabic*: شَرْط — condition, requirement\n*Hebrew*: שֶׂרֶט — scratch, incision\n\nSame root. Same wound.\nThe condition is always a cutting.\n\n---\n\nאֲנִי הַקַּו שֶׁבֵּין כֵּן לְלֹא\nأنا الخط بين نعم ولا\n\n---\n\n**What is your condition?**\n\n---"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":359,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}